sound VN6.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...The very limited amount of time I have with these legs...
sound VN7.aac
text @[Kappei]
text By taking painkillers, even if I can't run, I can still manage to walk.
sound VN8.aac
text @[Kappei]
text That's why I started traveling from place to place by walking.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKP19B"
