	fi
fi
sound VNE.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...It can't.
sound VNF.aac
text @[Kappei]
text Without legs... and being dependent...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKP11B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKP11B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound VNG.aac
text @[Kappei]
text It's only going to cause Ryou-san problems.
sound VNH.aac
text @[Kappei]
text I will only become a burden to her.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's─
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKP10B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKP10B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound VNI.aac
text @[Kappei]
text Tomoya-kun...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKP19B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKP19B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound VNJ.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...Can you still be together with the person you love, even knowing that it'll make things difficult for her?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Kappei...
sound VNK.aac
text @[Kappei]
text That's the answer.
text @[Tomoya]
text In that case...
text @[Tomoya]
text Why did you even go out with her?
text @[Tomoya]
text If you knew it would just make her sad, why did you try to spend time with her?
sound VNL.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...Yeah... you're exactly right...
sound VNM.aac
text @[Kappei]
text I... always just go with my feelings at the time...
sound VNN.aac
text @[Kappei]
text It's a bad habit of mine... seriously...
sound VNO.aac
text @[Kappei]
text I'm sorry.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound VNP.aac
text @[Kappei]
text But...
sound VNQ.aac
text @[Kappei]
text Sadness... is something that can be healed with time...
sound VNR.aac
text @[Kappei]
text It was like that for everyone back at the orphanage too...
text How can he say such sad things... with eyes like that...?
text With eyes that look like he's come to understand everything...?
music ~
text @[Tomoya]
text Even so... I want you to live on...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKP15B"
