text @[Kappei]
text ...Tomoya-kun...
music BGM18B.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text There is no way I can silently watch as a friend of mine dies, is there?
sound VNT.aac
text @[Kappei]
text Friend...?
text @[Tomoya]
text That's right. You were the first to call us friends, no?
text @[Kappei]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Even though you still have a chance to live...
text @[Tomoya]
text To give that up...
text @[Tomoya]
text Running isn't everything to you, is it?
text @[Tomoya]
text I...
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't know the you who ran.
text @[Tomoya]
text The Kappei Hiiragi that I know...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Is a guy who's selfish and does things as he pleases, a guy who doesn't get along with people well...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...He talks about weird stories about the past...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Sometimes he talks like a poet...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Sometimes he dashes right at you...
text @[Tomoya]
text My friend... is that kind of guy...
text @[Kappei]
text ...
