sound VNU.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...Thanks...
sound VNV.aac
text @[Kappei]
text Tomoya-kun, thanks...
sound VNW.aac
text @[Kappei]
text That's right... Tomoya-kun, only knows the Kappei Hiiragi as I am right now...
sound VNX.aac
text @[Kappei]
text Even though you didn't know about my past, you still came to meet me...
sound VNY.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...And told me that I'm your friend...
sound VNZ.aac
text @[Kappei]
text I'm...
sound VO0.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...really happy.
sound VO1.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...So...
sound VO2.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...I'm sorry...
text @[Tomoya]
text Kappei!
sound VO3.aac
text @[Kappei]
text ...Sorry...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ugh─
