music BGM16C.mp3
text I sit down on the bench, my head hanging down...
text Fujibayashi is sitting next to me, but doesn't say a thing.
text I... cannot bring myself to speak either...
text In the end, I couldn't persuade Kappei...
text A kid who knows nothing just explained what it means to live...
text Hearing him say all that makes me truly realize how feeble I am.
text After I leave the room, Fujibayashi starts crying...
text When I tell her I am sorry... she shakes her head and apologizes instead.
text Over and over, she apologizes...
sound VO4.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Okazaki-kun...
text Hearing her quiet voice, I raise my head.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGRY24D"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
