text @[Ryou]
text Uh... eh... weh... hic...
sound VO9.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Uwwwwwwwaaaaaahhh!
sound VOA.aac
text @[Ryou]
text Aaaaaaaaaannn! Uwwaaaaahhh!!
text Her voice pierces through my chest...
text Her tears are heavy...
text The tiny hands that she's gripping my clothes with...
text Her slender, trembling shoulders...
text The tears that run down her cheeks...
text In my arms, everything is filled with sorrow.
text Naturally, I tighten my grip.
text I hug Fujibayashi's trembling body tightly.
text That's because if I don't do that... I might start crying myself...
text At the very least... while I am here to keep her calm, I cannot cry...
text ...I must not cry...
text My eyes vibrate...
text To hold my tears back... I look up.
